Cell["\<\
Recover the static onsite and nearest-neighbor blocks after eliminating \
redundant photon sectors.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1419682233,ExpressionUUID->"a9f105bf-fb7c-6145-a459-f1bd1dea9ca9"],

